   "word": "ಕ್ಷ",
   "gloss": "kSha — spell it, get the conjunct",
   "built": "k S h → ಕ್ಷ್, then a strips the halant: k-S-h-a = ಕ್ಷ. No virama key needed — the layout composes it from the spelling.",
   "keys": [
    "k",
    "S",
    "h",
    "a"
   ]
  },
