   "word": "ಜ್ಞ",
   "gloss": "jñ — the classic jña, via ~ between j's",
   "built": "Type j then ~ then j then a: the ~ marks the ñ-ly-sound and the pair j-combines into the famous ಜ್ಞ ligature.",
